  {
   "id": "en.1.4.2",
   "title": "可数与不可数",
   "words": [
    "father",
    "sit",
    "away",
    "until",
    "power",
    "hour",
    "game",
    "often",
    "yet",
    "line",
    "political",
    "end"
   ],
   "grammar": [
    {
     "title": "能不能数，决定用什么词",
     "points": [
      "可数名词：有单复数，可以直接加数字：a book, two books。",
      "不可数名词：没有复数、不能直接加 a 或数字：water, money, information, advice, news, homework, furniture, music。",
      "要数不可数名词，加单位：a glass of water, a piece of advice, two pieces of information。",
      "many / few 修饰可数；much / little 修饰不可数；a lot of / some / any 两者都可以。",
      "some 用于肯定句和提供东西的疑问句（Would you like some tea?）；any 用于否定句和一般疑问句。"
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "How much money do you have?",
       "你有多少钱？"
      ],
      [
       "How many books did you buy?",
       "你买了几本书？"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "special": [
    {
     "w": "a piece of",
     "t": "固定搭配",
     "s": [
      [
       "",
       "一条/一块（修饰不可数名词）"
      ]
     ],
     "x": [
