   ],
   "grammar": [
    {
     "ref": "b_article"
    },
    {
     "title": "一句话记住",
     "points": [
      "a / an：第一次提到、泛指“一个”；the：双方都知道是哪一个。",
      "an 看<b>发音</b>不看字母：an hour, an honest man（h 不发音）；a university, a European（u 读 /juː/）。",
      "独一无二的东西用 the：the sun, the world, the internet。",
      "不用冠词：三餐（have breakfast）、球类（play tennis）、语言学科（study English）、by + 交通（by bus）、go to school/work/bed。"
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "I saw a dog. The dog was very big.",
       "我看见一只狗。那只狗很大。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
